+# EXT-PARTIES-1 replay and lifecycle continuation — 2026-10-07
+
+Current local source verification passes the complete existing Parties owner matrix: **784/784**, with zero errors/failures/skips/not-run cases and ten warning-free Debug builds. Fresh unchanged Platform custody verification adds **115/115**, making **899 distinct final passing tests**. This supersedes the historical Local destroyed-profile replay failure as a current source blocker. Complete production delivery and Level 4 acceptance remain open.
